        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emechando ase engencho y’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(1 Abar 15:17-22)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’emerongo etato, na etano nomo, bw’okogamba gwa Asa, Baasa, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, akagenda korwania Abayuda, akaagacha na kogitera omochie o Rama chindwaki ng’a nario ribaga ritabaise gotoka ase omonto onde bwensi gosoka, gose gosoa kogenda ase Asa, omorwoti bw’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Asa akarusia chifeta ne chitaabu korwa ase chikungo chi’enyomba y’Omonene na korwa ase echi’enyomba y’omorwoti, agachitoma gochia ase Beni‐Hadadi, omorwoti o Siiria omenyete agwo Damesiki, agateeba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tiga okobwatana kw’ogotianania kobe ase egati yane naye, buna kwarenge ase egati ya tata na iso. Rora nagotomeire chifeta ne chitaabu. Genda osarie okobwatana kwao gwakorete na Baasa, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, erinde arue ase ense yane, antigane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beni‐Hadadi akaigwera Asa omorwoti, agatoma abatang’ani b’abarwani baye, bakagenda bakarwania emechie y’Abaisraeli, bakabua Iyoni, na Dani, na Abeli‐Maimu, na emechie yonsi ase ebinto biagachire agwo ase orogongo rwa Nafutali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Baasa aigwete amang’ana ayio, agatiga kogita omochie o Rama, na emeremo yaye aroro egatenena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Asa omorwoti akaira Abayuda bonsi, na barabwo bakagenda bakabogoria amagena onsi a Rama, ne chibao, ebinto biria Baasa arenge koagachera, na ase ebio Asa akaagachera Geba na Misipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omobani Hanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eria Hanani omoorori agacha ase Asa, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, akamoteebia, “Ekiagera gwasemeretie omorwoti o Siiria, na tigwasemeri’Omonene, Nyasae oo, abasikari b’omorwoti o Siiria batamire betooririe korwa ase okoboko kwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Abanto b’Ethiopia na aba Libia tibarenge omoganda omonene bw’abasikari, naende tibabwate chigari chinyinge, na abariini chibarasi abange? Korende nonya naboigo, ekiagera aye gwasemeretie Omonene, akababeeka ase okoboko kwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaiso ’Omonene nigo origereretie aande onsi ase ense yonsi ase okoorokia okoboko kwaye kw’ogokonya abanto baria chinkoro chiabo chire chinyegenwa asare. Aye gwakorire amang’ana ’oboriri ase ogokora egento eke; na korwa bono na kogenderera nobe ne chiseegi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Asa akaba nendamwamu ase omorori oria, akamobwata, akamobeka ase echela, agasoyia amagoro aye ase rikorogoto. Nigo agechete omoorori oria mono, ekiagera akwanete amang’ana aria. Boigo ase engencho eyio Asa akaba omotindi mono, agachanda abanto bande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoerio bw’okogamba gwa Asa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(1 Abar 15:23-24)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya onsi Asa akorete, korwa omochakano goika omoerio, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’Abarwoti b’Abayuda na ab’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’emerongo etato na kianda bw’okogamba kwaye, Asa akanyora oborwaire ase amagoro aye, na oborwaire obo bokaba obonene; korende nonya obete omorwaire, tarigetie Omonene, korende akarigia ogokonywa korwa ase abarwaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa agakwa ase omwaka bw’emerongo ene nomo bw’okogamba kwaye, akarara ase chisokoro chiaye chiaraarete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agatindekwa ase oboina eroiseretie ere omonyene, agwo ase Omochie o Daudi. Bakamwareria ase ekeraarero giaichoretigwe ebinsari na amarembo ao ao, ebinto bigotioka buya, biaroisetigwe nabaroisia abang’aini. Abanto bagauta omorero omonene ase okworokia amasikani ase engencho ya Asa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
